WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.750
Guile Rushes toward standing Manon in the corner.

2
00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:01.400
Rush standing medium punch connects.

3
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.050
Down-forward heavy kick links after the medium punch.

4
00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:03.300
OD Sonic Boom begins the corner juggle.

5
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:04.500
Heavy Flash Kick catches Manon after the projectile.

6
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:04.750
Guile recovers as Manon falls in the corner.
